>I've often read people's opinions as to what to wish for, but have
>been such a newbie that half the time I don't know what they are
>talking about, and the other half I've thought I'd never get that far
>anyway :-)
>
>So - I have a wand of wishing (3).  What should I wish for?

Depends a lot on your situation.  For the upmteenth time, here is
my list of what to wish for.  Typically, wish for some way to
recharge the wand, some armor, and other stuff:

 High Priority
 -------------
 "blessed +2 gray dragon scale mail"
 "blessed rustproof +2 pair of speed boots"
 "blessed rustproof +2 gauntlets of power"
 "blessed +2 shield of reflection" (in 3.1.1 or later)
 "blessed amulet of life saving"
 "blessed wand of polymorph"
 "blessed bag of holding"
 "blessed magic marker"

 Medium Priority
 ---------------
 "blessed figurine of an Archon" (better than a sheild of reflection in 3.1.0)
 "blessed +2 Grayswandir" -> good against major demons
 "blessed rustproof +2 Mjollnir" -> Great if you're a Valkyrie
 "blessed rustproof +2 Vorpal Blade" -> good for a quick kill
 "blessed rustproof +2 Stormbringer" -> tough to control
 "blessed rustproof +2 Excalibur" -> protects against level drain
    -> many more weapons, but easier to get them by sacrificing
 "blessed platinum yendorian exress card (if Neutral)"
 "3 blessed scrolls of charging" (if not Neutral, and can't write it))
 "blessed tinning kit" (makes blessed tins)
 "3 blessed potions of gain ability"
 "3 blessed scrolls of genocide"
 "blessed ring of levitation" (you'll probably find one before endgame)
 "blessed ring of teleport control" (if you got teleport without control)
 "blessed luckstone" (get it in the mines instead of wishing)
 "blessed rustproof +2 helm of opposite alignment"

Low Priority
------------
 "blessed amulet of magical breathing"
 "blessed rustproof +2 water walking boots"
 "blessed rustproof +2 helm of brilliance"
 "blessed rustproof +2 helm of telepathy"
 "blessed rustproof +2 cloak of displacement"
 "blessed rustproof +2 Hawaiian shirt"
 "3 cursed scrolls of genocide" (caution is advised)
 "blessed spellbook of identify" -> or many other spell books

